### Phase 7 — 表單收件匣
###
### 三支前台表單（Contact / 產品詢價 / Partnership）都打 POST /contact，
### 由 `type` 分流。**送件成功的定義是入庫成功** —— SMTP 未設定時
### EmailSender 只記一行 log，不影響回應（CLAUDE.md §7 已封閉決議）。

@host = http://localhost:7071/api

# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@eunicemed.com", "password": "ChangeMe123!" }

###
@at = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 1a 一般洽詢 → 201，且 Smtp__Host 為空時 log 一行「SMTP not configured」
POST {{host}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "general",
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "subject": "Product availability",
  "message": "Do you ship compression stockings to the UK?",
  "locale": "en",
  "ipAddress": "203.0.113.7"
}

### 1b 產品詢價 → 檢查回應後用 1e 確認 ProductId 有被 SKU 反查填上
POST {{host}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "product",
  "name": "陳醫師",
  "email": "clinic@example.tw",
  "message": "想詢問這款護膝的批發價與最小訂購量。",
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "productSku": "AKS-01"
}

### 1c 合作洽詢
POST {{host}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "partnership",
  "name": "Marco Rossi",
  "email": "marco@distributor.it",
  "company": "Rossi Medical Supplies",
  "country": "IT",
  "partnershipType": "distributor",
  "message": "We would like to distribute EuniceMed in northern Italy.",
  "locale": "en"
}

### 1d 缺 message → 400
POST {{host}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "general", "name": "No Message", "email": "x@example.com" }

### 1e 未登入也能送 → 確認 IsPublicRoute 那條有效（上面幾支本來就沒帶 token）
###    連打 11 次後第 11 次應為 429（ContactRateLimiter 是 10 / 10 分鐘）

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 後台收件匣

### 2a 列表 → PagedResult 形狀
GET {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 2b 依類型與狀態篩選
GET {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions?type=product&status=received
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 2c 單筆詳情（把 id 換成 2a 回來的其中一筆）
@submissionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 2d 標記已處理
PATCH {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "handled" }

### 2e CSV 匯出 → text/csv，開頭有 BOM
GET {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions/export
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

### 2f 未知狀態 → 400
PATCH {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "archived" }

### 2g 未登入取列表 → 401
GET {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions

### 2h Viewer 角色：GET 應 200、PATCH 應 403
###    （用 Viewer 帳號重跑 login 之後執行 2a 與 2d）

### 2i 側欄徽章：summary 應含 contact-submissions 的未處理筆數
GET {{host}}/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}

###############################################################################
# 3. reCAPTCHA v3（2026-08-31）
#
# 前提：`Recaptcha__SecretKey` 有值且 `Recaptcha__Disabled` 不是 true。
# ⚠️ **低分不擋件**：以下每一條都回 201，差別只在入庫的 Status 與有沒有寄通知信。
###############################################################################

### 3a 帶 token → Google 測試 secret 回 success 但**沒有 score** → Status=received
# 測試 secret：6LeIxAcTAAAAAGG-vFI1TnRWxMZNFuojJ4WifJWe（Google 文件的公開測試金鑰，只有 v2）
POST {{host}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "general", "name": "Case A", "email": "a@example.com", "message": "hi", "recaptchaToken": "anything" }

### 3b 沒帶 token（機器人直接打 API）→ Status=spam、不寄信
POST {{host}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "general", "name": "Case B", "email": "b@example.com", "message": "hi" }

### 3c 分數門檻
# v3 沒有官方測試金鑰（見 docs/13 踩坑），要驗門檻得把 Recaptcha__VerifyUrl 指到假服務：
#   Recaptcha__VerifyUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8099/
#   假服務：token 為 "low" 回 score 0.1，其餘回 0.9
# 預期：low → Status=spam 且 RecaptchaScore=0.1；high → Status=received 且 0.9
POST {{host}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "general", "name": "Score low", "email": "low@example.com", "message": "hi", "recaptchaToken": "low" }

### 3d 驗證服務連不上 → **放行**（Status=received、分數 null）
# 把上面那支假服務關掉再送一次即可。Google 掛掉不是送件者的問題。

### 3e 後台詳情要帶 recaptchaScore（收件匣靠它說明為什麼被標成垃圾）
GET {{host}}/admin/contact-submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{at}}
